      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Iron Eagle blessed land, righteous path Gu Immortals identify a concealed sword path junior who shoots into the blessed land as from Nian Er tribe, named Nian Er Ping Zhi. He beheads Qing Xuan Zi and announces the kill.",
      "chapters": [
        1105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_nian_er_ping_zhi",
        "char_qing_xuan_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan compares hard inheritances and names Nian Er tribe’s Nian Er Sword Saint true inheritance: an inheritor appears only every few hundred years, and the current one is Nian Er Ping Zhi. Hei Fan and Nian Er Sword Saint left difficult requirements so unworthy successors would not tarnish their names.",
      "chapters": [
        1132
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sword-saint-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "inh_sword_saint_true_inheritance",
        "char_hei_fan",
        "char_sword_saint_nian_er"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nian Er tribe stands among eleven Huang Jin tribes that rule territories and hold undisputed influence in Northern Plains’ Gu Immortal world, listed with Liu, Ye Lui, Chanyu, Meng, Yuan, Murong, and Guan tribes among others. At the seating, Nian Er Ping Zhi is outraged that Nian Er tribe is placed last. Wood path Gu Immortal Nian Er Yi Fang tells him to kill opponents in the blood martial competition to raise the tribe’s prestige, and Nian Er Fu is also present among the tribe’s seniors.",
      "chapters": [
        1193
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "huang-jin-gathering",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "path_wood",
        "char_nian_er_yi_fang",
        "char_nian_er_fu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nian Er Ping Zhi is named a shining member of the righteous path’s younger generation and the current Sword Child of Nian Er tribe, fighting with quick movement and lightning sword light. Nian Er Yi Fang later credits sword heart clarity from the Sword Saint true inheritance when Ping Zhi breaks Granny Yin’s bewitching soul art, and uses the moment to raise Nian Er tribe’s prestige. For Nian Er tribe, keeping Nian Er Ping Zhi alive outranks rules or reputation when the fight turns against him.",
      "chapters": [
        1196
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "duel-with-granny-yin",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_sword_child",
        "char_granny_yin"
      ]
    }
